{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393165-true-fae","id":1393165,"title":"True Fae?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-31T11:52:35-07:00","id":1393165,"title":"True Fae?","content":"Please tell me, what\u2019s the true fae? What traits do they have? I used to hear that they are very great beings. Thanks<br /> <br /> Sorry but I know few about CtD. I recall some say Dark Age: Fae talks about them, which is much closer to the \u201cclassical\u201d fae, the fae in the first WoD books like VtM ST Handbook 1st Ed, not changelings","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T12:19:30-07:00","id":1393171,"title":"","content":"In Dark Ages: Fae, there are three possible Origins for a character: Changeling, Inanimae, and Firstborn. Mechanically, the main difference between them were that the Changelings were more inclined towards Weaving and Cantrips, the Firstborn were more inclined towards the Mists and Unleashings, and the Inanimae occupied a middle ground between them. <br /> <br /> Dark Ages: Fae also replaced the system of Kiths with build-your-own-mien system that resulted in the protagonists being one-of-a-kind entities instead of falling into the comparatively rigid types setup that Changeling features. It also replaced the Arts and Realms system with a set of four Dominions that resemble Mage's Spheres far more closely than they resemble Changeling's Arts and Realms. Finally, it replaced the Seelie/Unseelie divide with a Seasonal Courts system (Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter). If I recall correctly, each Court had an affinity with one of the Dominions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-31T14:36:19-07:00","id":1393216,"title":"","content":"Basically what Dataweaver said.<br /> <br /> The first fae were beings of pure glamour, dream, and inspiration. Whether they were born first from the dreams of humanity or sleeping gods, neither or both, is hard to say and ultimately doesn't matter much aside from ST decision.<br /> <br /> The firstborn largely became what modern kithain would recognize as the Tuatha, The Fomorians, and basically every pantheon has had its representatives amongst The Dreaming. These were beings of pure glamour who could exist prior to the Shattering and were weakening because of the Sundering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}